  "observations": [
    "CIPTA 2027 has five distinct local and ASEAN categories. January 25 is the application and abstract deadline, not event start. May–June finals lack exact dates. Junior Year 7–9 and ID/school conditions, hardware rule for older divisions, and written English/Malay allowed in specific divisions preserved. Proposal language not promoted to oral judging language.",
    "BICTA primary Year 4–6 and secondary Year 7–11 with local schools. July 2026 judging archived, next dates unknown. BICTA Plus free school workshops carry separate citizen/permanent-resident requirement. AITI Tech Kids targets Year 3–5 in March generally, next dates unannounced. ROBIN 2025 separates Robo Sumo and Innovation and SELYI school route.",
    "APICTA Jakarta FAQ judges December 9–10, review/ceremony December 11. The official programme schedules exhibition and conference December 8–9. Delegate arrival December 7 and departure December 12 are not exhibition days. Indonesia Junior SD/SMP versus Senior and Tertiary are separate; age rules by economy. Host registration pages use conflicting dates already in the past. Competition nomination distinct from admission to exhibition, family access unknown.",
    "StudySmartable admission age from 6, home advertises general 4–16 range. English understanding required, actual instruction language for the specific class not certified. Tuition includes materials, registration and some equipment/competitions may be extra. Seria Energy Lab family passes 25 BND, children 7, adults 9. DFCE and CySec are industry events; admission and child rules for next editions unverified.",
    "Cook Islands club opened 2027 applications through February 28. Month-level school term schedule March–September, no exact sessions, club and overseas squad admission separate. $150, additional sibling 50% off, currency code unprinted. Separate Kuki programme 8–13 and old holiday cohorts 8–10 or 8–12, upcoming dates unknown.",
    "Bermuda TOYA current organizer home gives P1–P5, three sites, 11 days Dec 17–31 and Jan 4, registration opening Nov 23, $140 or four vouchers. Do not infer an exact day-by-day schedule or currency. Connectech after-school 7+ with no groups currently listed, CubeSat no latest cohort date, BZS 11–14 winter details pending. National FIRST Global and local camp/visitor routes separately catalogued.",
    "British Virgin Islands government showcase is 2025 evidence with new date unannounced. St Kitts July 22 lesson during two-week robotics camp was verified, no full 2027 intake. Cook Islands, Bermuda, BVI, Tonga and Vanuatu 2026 team profiles establish local participation routes with no open selection inference.",
    "Bhutan GovTech historical 2026 dates and general annual pattern kept separate. Sarawak Science Centre official July opening, general free entry through Dec 31, exhibits mostly English and Bahasa Malaysia, separate workshop rules."
  ]
